### Ví dụ 1: Customer Onboarding Workflow

```typescript
// Customer onboarding automation workflow
const customerOnboardingWorkflow = {
  name: 'customer_onboarding',
  description: 'Automate customer onboarding process',
  nodes: [
    {
      id: 'trigger',
      name: 'New Signup Webhook',
      type: 'n8n-nodes-base.webhook',
      parameters: {
        httpMethod: 'POST',
        path: 'customer-signup',
        responseMode: 'lastNode'
      },
      position: { x: 0, y: 0 }
    },
    {
      id: 'validate',
      name: 'Validate Input',
      type: 'n8n-nodes-base.code',
      parameters: {
        jsCode: `
          const data = $input.item.json;
          const errors = [];
          
          if (!data.email || !data.email.includes('@')) {
            errors.push('Invalid email');
          }
          if (!data.company) {
            errors.push('Company name required');
          }
          
          if (errors.length > 0) {
            throw new Error(errors.join(', '));
          }
          
          return { json: data };
        `
      },
      position: { x: 250, y: 0 }
    },
    {
      id: 'create-crm',
      name: 'Create CRM Contact',
      type: 'n8n-nodes-base.hubspot',
      parameters: {
        operation: 'create',
        email: '={{$json.email}}',
        additionalFields: {
          company: '={{$json.company}}',
          firstname: '={{$json.firstName}}'
        }
      },
      position: { x: 500, y: 0 }
    },
    {
      id: 'send-welcome',
      name: 'Send Welcome Email',
      type: 'n8n-nodes-base.emailSend',
      parameters: {
        to: '={{$json.email}}',
        subject: 'Welcome to our platform!',
        body: '={{ $templateLib.welcomeEmail($json) }}'
      },
      position: { x: 750, y: 0 }
    },
    {
      id: 'notify-sales',
      name: 'Notify Sales Team',
      type: 'n8n-nodes-base.slack',
      parameters: {
        channel: '#new-customers',
        text: 'New customer: {{$json.company}}'
      },
      position: { x: 750, y: 200 }
    }
  ],
  connections: {
    'New Signup Webhook': {
      main: [[{ node: 'Validate Input', type: 'main', index: 0 }]]
    },
    'Validate Input': {
      main: [[{ node: 'Create CRM Contact', type: 'main', index: 0 }]]
    },
    'Create CRM Contact': {
      main: [
        [{ node: 'Send Welcome Email', type: 'main', index: 0 }],
        [{ node: 'Notify Sales Team', type: 'main', index: 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
};
```

## Anti Patterns (Các pattern cần tránh)

### 1. Monolithic Workflow
```typescript
// ❌ BAD: One huge workflow
// 50 nodes all in one workflow
// Impossible to test or debug

// ✅ GOOD: Modular workflows
// Split into sub-workflows
// Each handles one concern
```

### 2. No Error Handling
```typescript
// ❌ BAD: No error handling
// Nodes just fail silently
// No retries, no alerts

// ✅ GOOD: Comprehensive error handling
// Retry policies
// Error workflows
// Alert notifications
```

### 3. Hardcoded Values
```typescript
// ❌ BAD: Hardcoded credentials
parameters: {
  password: 'secret123'
}

// ✅ GOOD: Environment variables
parameters: {
  password: '={{$env.DB_PASSWORD}}'
}
```

## Best Practices (Thực hành tốt nhất)

1. **Start simple**: Small, working workflows first
2. **Use sub-workflows**: Reuse common patterns
3. **Handle errors**: Always have error handling
4. **Log everything**: For debugging and auditing
5. **Use credentials**: Never hardcode secrets
6. **Test thoroughly**: Test each node individually
7. **Monitor execution**: Track success/failure rates
8. **Document workflows**: Explain what each does
9. **Version control**: Keep workflows in git
10. **Consider scaling**: Design for expected load

